    <artifactId>godikit-logger</artifactId>
    <version>${revision}</version>
    <name>GodiKit Logger</name>
    <description>Core API artifact of GodiKit Logger for JDK 8+. Defines the Logger interface, the LoggerFactory entry
        point, and the LoggerProvider SPI protocol, with built-in No-Op and System.out fallback providers and automatic
        MDC trace ID injection. Backend implementations are supplied as separate provider artifacts and discovered
        through the JDK ServiceLoader mechanism.
    </description>
